          %h2#references References
          %p The original reference is
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean-Louis+Koszul"}> Jean-Louis Koszul
              ,
              %em Homologie et cohomologie des algèbres de Lie
              , Bulletin de la Société Mathématique de France, 78, 1950, pp 65-127.
          %p A standard textbook reference is
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Weibel"}> Charles Weibel
              , section 4.5 of
              %em Homological algebra
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.unam.mx/javier/weibel.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            A generalization of Koszul complexes to (appropriate resolutions of)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebras+over+operads"} algebras over operads
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              Joan Millès,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Koszul complex is the cotangent complex
              %a{:href => "http://www.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/preprints/send?bid=4143"} pdf
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li#Wikipedia
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koszul_complex"} Koszul complex
